    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The  Employment Collection\u00a9 is an anthology of indie games by developers from across the world, themed around the subject of employment, corporate culture, and the horrors of modern day late-stage capitalism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each purchase directly supports current and future indie game developers in the ultra/hyper-indie gamedev scene. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Games: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BoxCorp by Hyphinett</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Passage: Chapter 1 &amp; 2 by Emcat Games </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">My Dream Job: How I Survived Job Hunting in Animation by Bubbly Oasis </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chaos Lab by Robert Doman</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Office Combat by Robert Doman</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Job at Risk by Hraezvelg</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mud Slinger by Amon26</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crap Job\u00a0by Oniric Factor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crazy Factory by Oniric Factor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Note: Crap Job (Mesen) SteamPlay on Linux via Proton requires that you have mono-complete, libsdl2, and gnome-themes-standard installed. </i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The  Employment Collection\u00a9 is an anthology of indie games by developers from across the world, themed around the subject of employment, corporate culture, and the horrors of modern day late-stage capitalism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each purchase directly supports current and future indie game developers in the ultra/hyper-indie gamedev scene. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Games: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BoxCorp by Hyphinett</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Passage: Chapter 1 &amp; 2 by Emcat Games </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">My Dream Job: How I Survived Job Hunting in Animation by Bubbly Oasis </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chaos Lab by Robert Doman</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Office Combat by Robert Doman</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Job at Risk by Hraezvelg</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mud Slinger by Amon26</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crap Job\u00a0by Oniric Factor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crazy Factory by Oniric Factor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Note: Crap Job (Mesen) SteamPlay on Linux via Proton requires that you have mono-complete, libsdl2, and gnome-themes-standard installed. </i></p>",
